# Generated Excel files (round-trip artifacts, never commit)
*.xlsm
uploads/

# Docs — generated output. Rebuild with `npm run docs:build` / `npm run plan:csv`.
# build.mjs rm -rf's docs/html on every run, so committing it is pure diff noise.
docs/html/
docs/generated/

# Docs — external reference PDFs too large to version. The 2567 curriculum PDF
# is 135 MB and would dominate every clone; it is an unmodified external
# document, so share it via Drive. docs/pdf/ is otherwise tracked — the
# project's own deliverables there are small and belong in git.
docs/pdf/01.*.pdf

# MySQL Workbench autosave backups
*.mwb.bak
